      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Issue a <b>QUARANTINE</b> when symptoms are present but uncertain.


        Quarantine
        allows us to cure their symptoms and prevents a subject from full mutation,
        unless they''re already past the point of no return.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
